### KSeF 2.0 collective identifier (IZ) calls - TEST environment only.
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Paste an access token from `ksefiz auth-test --env test` into @accessToken. Never commit a real token.
### Identifiers below are synthetic (see README.md). Replace them with KSeF numbers that exist on TEST.

@baseUrl = https://api-test.ksef.mf.gov.pl/v2
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@continuationToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_PREVIOUS_PAGE

### Context limits: collectiveIdentifier.maxInvoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/limits/context
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

### Rate limits: collectiveIdentifier group
GET {{baseUrl}}/rate-limits
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

### M5 Generate: one IZ for 2..maxInvoices invoices of one seller (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/collective-identifiers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

{
  "invoices": [
    {"ksefNumber": "3023936130-20261015-95E3B5D45D27-F0", "payment": {"amount": 1230.00, "currency": "PLN"}, "description": "FV/2026/10/0141"},
    {"ksefNumber": "3023936130-20261015-18B2EE11E992-5E", "payment": {"amount": 455.25, "currency": "PLN"}, "description": "FV/2026/10/0142"}
  ]
}

### M3 Decode: up to 10 IZ, pageSize 10..500 (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/collective-identifiers/invoices?pageSize=500
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

{
  "collectiveIdentifierNumbers": ["3023936130-IZ202610-5A87E99ED6AE-57"]
}

### M3 Decode, next page: same body, token in the header
POST {{baseUrl}}/collective-identifiers/invoices?pageSize=500
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details
x-continuation-token: {{continuationToken}}

{
  "collectiveIdentifierNumbers": ["3023936130-IZ202610-5A87E99ED6AE-57"]
}

### M6 Reverse lookup: IZ that contain one KSeF number, pageSize 10..200 (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collective-identifiers/ksef/3023936130-20261015-95E3B5D45D27-F0?pageSize=200
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

### M7 Period query: IZ created in the context, window at most 100 days (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/collective-identifiers/query?pageSize=200
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details

{
  "dateCreatedFrom": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000+00:00",
  "dateCreatedTo": "2026-10-31T23:59:59.999+00:00",
  "createdInCurrentContext": true
}

### Close the session when done (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Error-Format: problem-details
